Touch orientation hunks from Armada (armada-os/armada@939fb84,
packages/kernel/dts/qcs8550-ayn-thor.dts.patch), regenerated for this tree.
Both touchscreens report in panel-native (portrait) coordinates, like the RP6's;
gamescope and KWin rotate them with the panel. With the kernel swapping and
inverting as well, taps were rotated twice. Armada's hall-wake and DPU dither
hunks are not taken (dither needs Armada's DPU patch).

From: Armada <noreply@armada.local>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: thor: touch orientation

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs8550-ayn-thor.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs8550-ayn-thor.dts
@@ -275,8 +275,6 @@
 
 		touchscreen-size-x = <1080>;
 		touchscreen-size-y = <1920>;
-		touchscreen-swapped-x-y;
-		touchscreen-inverted-x;
 
 		label = "top_touchscreen";
 	};
@@ -393,8 +391,6 @@
 
 		touchscreen-size-x = <1080>;
 		touchscreen-size-y = <1240>;
-		touchscreen-swapped-x-y;
-		touchscreen-inverted-x;
 
 		label = "bottom_touchscreen";
 
